  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Study of effectiveness of core funding to CSOs in field of HR and IHL in the oPt - Study of effectiveness of core funding to CSOs</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Study of effectiveness of core funding to CSOs in field of HR and IHL in the oPt</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Studien skall utreda och analysera effekten av k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till civilsamh&#xe4;lls organisationer som finansieras genom MR/IHL Sekretariatet. Studien kommer &#xe4;ven vara bidra till den planerade halvtids&#xf6;versynen av st&#xf6;det till MR/IHL Sekretariatet. Syftet med studien &#xe4;r att ge v&#xe4;gledning till de fyra givarl&#xe4;nderna, f&#xf6;r framtida st&#xf6;d inklusive niv&#xe5;er av k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till organisationerna. Studien kommer att publiceras i Sidas serie f&#xf6;r utv&#xe4;rderingar.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The assessment shall review and analyze the effectiveness of core support to the civil society organisations financed through the HR/IHL Secretariat. The study is intended to provide guidance for the donor group&#x2019;s decision making regarding future support including advice of different levels of support to an organisation.The study will also feed in to the mid-term review of the Secretariat which will be carried out in January-February 2015-2016. The study will also be published in the Sida series for evaluations.</narrative>
  </description>
